WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.656 --> 00:00:16.698
jumped to his feet and pulled out his iron bar.

2
00:00:16.718 --> 00:00:20.380
"Who did that?"

3
00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:22.862
Bippo hid behind Roxy's head.

4
00:00:22.882 --> 00:00:25.984
"Scary, him."

5
00:00:28.946 --> 00:00:29.607
Roxy grinned.

6
00:00:29.627 --> 00:00:31.348
"Sorry, Wukong!"

7
00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:34.333
Wukong lowered his iron bar.

8
00:00:34.353 --> 00:00:36.375
"Rocket Girl!

9
00:00:36.835 --> 00:00:38.036
What are you doing here?"

10
00:00:38.056 --> 00:00:40.198
"We need your help."

11
00:00:41.259 --> 00:00:42.820
Roxy introduced him to Cozlin.

12
00:00:43.881 --> 00:00:45.883
Bippo peeked out from behind Roxy's head.

13
00:00:45.903 --> 00:00:48.165
"A demon!"

14
00:00:49.066 --> 00:00:50.487
Wukong raised his iron bar.

15
00:00:51.468 --> 00:00:52.869
Bippo hid under Roxy's cape.

16
00:00:52.889 --> 00:00:55.771
"No!" Roxy cried.

17
00:00:55.791 --> 00:00:58.333
"This is Bippo—he's with us."

18
00:00:59.154 --> 00:01:01.216
Roxy held Bippo out for Wukong to see.

19
00:01:04.604 --> 00:01:04.864
"Scary, you!"

20
00:01:04.884 --> 00:01:05.305
Bippo said.

21
00:01:06.305 --> 00:01:07.626
Wukong looked confused.

22
00:01:07.646 --> 00:01:11.529
"Is he a spirit?"

23
00:01:12.529 --> 00:01:13.270
Roxy giggled.

24
00:01:15.011 --> 00:01:17.813
"Nope. He's a robot."

25
00:01:18.393 --> 00:01:19.274
Cozlin snorted.

26
00:01:19.294 --> 00:01:25.498
"Roxy, how is this, um, thing going to help us?"

27
00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:28.380
Wukong frowned.

28
00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:30.222
"I'm not a thing.

29
00:01:30.242 --> 00:01:33.384
I'm Sun Wukong, the Monkey King!

30
00:01:34.512 --> 00:01:36.913
I once defeated Heaven's entire army!"

31
00:01:38.114 --> 00:01:39.335
Cozlin held up her hands.

32
00:01:39.355 --> 00:01:41.896
"Okay, okay!

33
00:01:42.537 --> 00:01:45.138
We need your help destroying a robot army."

34
00:01:47.419 --> 00:01:52.082
"I'd like to help you," Wukong said.

35
00:01:52.102 --> 00:01:55.744
"But I must find the Tang Monk, Bajie, and Wujing.

36
00:01:56.825 --> 00:01:59.366
I think they were kidnapped by chipmunk demons."

37
00:01:59.386 --> 00:02:02.368
"Chipmunk demons?"

38
00:02:03.412 --> 00:02:04.553
Roxy raised an eyebrow.

39
00:02:07.075 --> 00:02:09.337
"Your world is strange, Wukong.

40
00:02:10.398 --> 00:02:11.579
But what if we help you?

41
00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:14.001
Then could you help us?"

42
00:02:14.021 --> 00:02:16.583
"Sure," Wukong said.

43
00:02:16.603 --> 00:02:19.265
"I was saying earlier that I was bored.

44
00:02:20.326 --> 00:02:21.787
Today is turning out to be exciting.

45
00:02:22.628 --> 00:02:24.769
We just need to figure out where the demons are.

46
00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:29.213
Demons usually live on mountains, but there aren't any mountains here."

47
00:02:31.175 --> 00:02:32.275
He flew up into the air.

48
00:02:36.104 --> 00:02:38.846
In the distance he saw a dark cloud near a wide river.

49
00:02:38.866 --> 00:02:42.608
"Aha! Demons!"

50
00:02:44.229 --> 00:02:47.731
He led Roxy and Cozlin to the spot and found a cave in the bank of the river.

51
00:02:49.552 --> 00:02:52.313
The cave's entrance was blocked by a heavy-looking door.

52
00:02:53.354 --> 00:02:56.055
Creepy twisted trees stood tall along the river.

53
00:02:56.075 --> 00:03:01.098
"This place is spooky," Roxy said.

54
00:03:01.118 --> 00:03:03.760
Wukong waved a hand.

55
00:03:04.924 --> 00:03:06.446
"Trees can't hurt you."

56
00:03:07.286 --> 00:03:09.528
He took out his iron bar and smashed the door.

57
00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:13.391
"Release my friends right now.

58
00:03:13.692 --> 00:03:17.175
Or I'll smash this entire cave and destroy every single one of you!"

59
00:03:19.337 --> 00:03:20.798
The chipmunk demons hurried out.

60
00:03:20.818 --> 00:03:24.321
"How dare you yell at us!"

61
00:03:24.921 --> 00:03:25.622
one of them said.

62
00:03:25.642 --> 00:03:30.066
"Look at this," another one said, pointing to the broken door.

63
00:03:30.086 --> 00:03:31.987
"He smashed our door!"

64
00:03:33.636 --> 00:03:37.198
"That is so rude," the third chipmunk demon said.

65
00:03:38.578 --> 00:03:39.879
Roxy tried not to laugh.

66
00:03:39.899 --> 00:03:44.300
"These are demons, Wukong?

67
00:03:45.221 --> 00:03:46.621
They look kind of cute."

68
00:03:48.202 --> 00:03:51.843
"Grr!" The chipmunk demons attacked.

69
00:03:51.864 --> 00:03:56.145
"Ahh!" Roxy swatted one demon with her hand.

70
00:03:57.886 --> 00:04:02.528
Poof! The demon turned into a regular chipmunk, which scurried away into the forest.

71
00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:06.681
Cozlin hit a second demon with a laser blast.

72
00:04:07.461 --> 00:04:11.362
Poof! It also turned into a regular chipmunk and scurried away.

73
00:04:12.442 --> 00:04:15.883
The third demon took a step back as Wukong raised his iron bar.

74
00:04:15.903 --> 00:04:20.285
"You should all leave," the demon said.

75
00:04:20.305 --> 00:04:24.986
"Our boss is going to be very angry with you!"

76
00:04:25.006 --> 00:04:27.066
Wukong laughed.

77
00:04:30.007 --> 00:04:32.708
"I'm not afraid of chipmunks!"

78
00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:36.581
"He's not a chipmunk," the demon said.

79
00:04:36.601 --> 00:04:38.401
"He's bigger."

80
00:04:39.421 --> 00:04:40.582
Wukong laughed again.

81
00:04:40.602 --> 00:04:43.263
"Oh, really?

82
00:04:43.683 --> 00:04:44.903
What type of demon is he?

83
00:04:45.403 --> 00:04:47.044
A squirrel demon?"

84
00:04:48.324 --> 00:04:51.545
Just then thick branches grabbed Wukong, Roxy, and Cozlin.

85
00:04:51.565 --> 00:04:57.546
"I'm the Demon of Mighty Roots," a deep voice said.

86
00:04:57.566 --> 00:05:04.416
"I'm going to eat the Tang Monk and live forever!"
